---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Government Modernization | Phil Burney for Commissioner"
  description="Phil Burney's platform on automating county services and building collaboration across Rutherford County departments."
>
  <section class="section platform-hero">
    <p class="tag">Platform</p>
    <h1>Government Modernization</h1>
    <blockquote class="platform-quote">
      "In the current state, Rutherford County government departments are siloed off more than they should be,
      leading to inefficiencies and missed opportunities. Identifying automation and collaboration opportunities
      will unlock new opportunities for the county and save taxpayer dollars."
    </blockquote>
    <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline back-link">← All Platform Issues</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section platform-stack">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Automation Opportunities</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Many routine county functions — permit tracking, records requests, payment
        processing, scheduling — still rely on manual steps that cost staff time and
        frustrate residents.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Audit county workflows to identify repetitive manual processes ripe for automation</li>
        <li>Use technology to flag backlogs and bottlenecks before they become constituent complaints</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Inter-Department Collaboration</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Too often, county departments operate in isolation — duplicating work, missing
        opportunities to share resources, and leaving residents to navigate between
        offices on their own. 
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Establish regular cross-department coordination meetings to surface shared challenges and opportunities</li>
        <li>Identify services that touch multiple departments and create shared workflows to eliminate redundancy</li>
        <li>Encourage joint grant applications and shared purchasing to stretch county resources further</li>
        <li>Build a county-wide staff communication platform so teams can collaborate without siloed inboxes</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>A county government that actually works</h2>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/donations" class="btn btn-primary">Support the Campaign</a>
        <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline-light">View All Issues</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
